# tests/host/goldens/MANIFEST — frozen pre-migration C tool outputs.
#
# Each test in tests/host/0XX_*.sh that has a deterministic output checks
# its produced artifacts against the golden(s) listed below. PR2 Tasks 3-7
# replace the C tools with Rust ports; the Rust output must byte-match
# these files (the parity contract).
#
# Format: <test>/<file>: <tool> against <fixture>
# Lines starting with '#' are comments.
#
# Reproducibility: gbl-pack honors SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH (added in this commit)
# to pin its embedded ISO timestamp. Tests that invoke gbl-pack set
# SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH=0 at the top. The GBL_TOOL_VERSION embedded in
# packer_version comes from the in-tree VERSION file, so it's branch-stable.

# ---- gbl-pack + abl-patcher (core packing path) ----
060/payload.bin:       gbl-pack against infiniti-EU-16.0.5.703 PE + its pre-patched form
060/patched.efi:       abl-patcher against infiniti-EU-16.0.5.703 PE
061/clean.bin:         gbl-pack against infiniti-EU-16.0.5.703 PE (pre-poison fuzz baseline)
064/infiniti-EU-16.0.5.703.bin:         gbl-pack against the EU.703 PE fixture
064/infiniti-EU-16.0.5.703.patched.efi: abl-patcher against the EU.703 PE fixture
067/payload.bin:       gbl-pack against infiniti-EU-16.0.5.703 PE
067/efisp.img:         patched.efi || payload.bin concat (synthetic raw EFISP)
069/payload.bin:       gbl-pack against infiniti-EU-16.0.5.703 PE (full-buffer scan input)

